AMD register and firmware-interface headers for GFX8 (Stoney Ridge), copied
unchanged from Linux v6.12, drivers/gpu/drm/amd (include/asic_reg/..., include/,
amdgpu/vid.h, amdgpu/clearstate_*.h, pm/powerplay/inc/...).

Ported-from: Linux v6.12, https://github.com/torvalds/linux/tree/v6.12/drivers/gpu/drm/amd
